Copyright 2026 Graphcore Ltd.

This clean extraction is derived from Graphcore's gc-training repository at
commit 99a96f2a345ab4a9d37904cfdcdf93777458106d.

The floating-point format and rounding implementation follows numerical logic
previously adapted from NVIDIA TransformerEngine, which is distributed under
the Apache License 2.0.  The source revision inspected during extraction was
01aef4fc721bd12fd09cd56d53a314aee1b953d6.  The extracted implementation is
reduced to the E2M1 and unsigned-E5M3 behaviors needed by this project and adds
the UE5M3 recipe, scale lifecycle, tests, and documentation.
